3.TCP three-way handshake
 
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server

    C->>S: SYN
    Note over C,S: Connection request
    S-->>C: SYN-ACK
    Note over C,S: Server accepts request
    C->>S: ACK
    Note over C,S: Connection established

4: DHCP DORA process
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as DHCP Client
    participant S as DHCP Server

    D->>S: DHCP Discover
    S-->>D: DHCP Offer
    D->>S: DHCP Request
    S-->>D: DHCP Acknowledge
    Note over D,S: IP configuration assigned

